  "name": "sensor-state-no-value-without-reports",
  "description": "a no value for 10 minutes rule on a source that reports no state is false at readings with a value, false while readings with no value have lasted less than 10 minutes, true from 10 minutes on, and false again at the next reading with a value; it never holds",
